    "faqSectionLabel": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "faqSectionTitle": "Got questions? We've got answers.",
    "faq1Q": "What is VedicMindAI, exactly?",
    "faq1A": "VedicMindAI is a complete learning platform built on three pillars: Vedic Mathematics (ancient fast-calculation techniques called sutras), Intelligent Reasoning (logical thinking and pattern recognition), and Mindful Aptitude (coming soon). \"Ancient Wisdom, Modern Speed\" isn't just a tagline — we add new lessons, fix real issues, and expand the platform continuously, week over week, based on genuine feedback from real students and teachers using it.",
    "faq2Q": "Who is VedicMindAI actually for — just students?",
    "faq2A": "No — it's built for three groups together. Students get structured lessons and gamified daily practice. Teachers get visibility into how their whole class is progressing, not just one child. Parents get a clear, simple view of their own child's growth. All three see the same progress from their own side, which is exactly what makes it useful in a real classroom, not just at home.",
    "faq2bQ": "Which classes and students is VedicMindAI for?",
    "faq2bA": "VedicMindAI is built for school students from Class 1 through Class 12, across CBSE, ICSE, and State Boards, as well as competitive exam aspirants preparing for JEE, NEET, and SSC. Our curriculum spans 40 lessons across 4 levels, covering 16 core Vedic sutras.",
    "faq2cQ": "How does VedicMindAI help teachers track student progress?",
    "faq2cA": "Teachers get class-wide visibility — not just one student's report, but how the whole class is progressing: who's active daily, who's falling behind, and where the common gaps are. This is designed to support classroom teaching, not replace it, giving teachers real data instead of guesswork.",
    "faq2dQ": "Can our school get VedicMindAI for all our students?",
    "faq2dA": "Yes — we offer institutional licensing so an entire school or coaching institute gets access, with class-wide progress tracking for teachers and administrators. Visit our Collaborate page to start a conversation about a pilot for your school.",
    "faq2eQ": "Will VedicMindAI conflict with what our school already teaches?",
    "faq2eA": "No — Vedic Maths techniques run alongside your existing CBSE/ICSE/State Board syllabus, not against it. They give students faster methods for the same calculations they're already learning in class, which supports board exam performance rather than competing with it.",
    "faq3Q": "How much does VedicMindAI cost?",
    "faq3A": "You can start for free and explore real lessons right away. Paid plans (Basic, Pro, and Family) unlock full access to all lessons, unlimited quiz attempts, and premium features like the AI Tutor. Visit our Pricing page for current rates in INR or USD.",
    "faq4Q": "What is the Daily Quiz?",
    "faq4A": "A short quiz refreshed every day, mixing Vedic Maths and Reasoning questions, designed to build a consistent daily practice habit and compete with your classmates on the leaderboard.",
    "faq5Q": "What is the AI Tutor?",
    "faq5A": "The AI Tutor is available inside lessons to answer your questions in real time — stuck on a step or want something explained differently, just ask.",
    "faq6Q": "Can I use the app in Hindi?",
    "faq6A": "Yes — VedicMindAI fully supports both Hindi and English. Just tap the language toggle in the top navigation bar to switch anytime.",
    "faq7Q": "What is your refund policy?",
    "faq7A": "We offer a full, no-questions-asked refund if you request it within 7 days of your payment date. After that, you can cancel anytime to stop future charges. Email admin@vedicmindai.in to request a refund.",
    "faq8Q": "I forgot my password. What do I do?",
    "faq8A": "On the sign-in page, tap \"Forgot Password?\" and answer your security question to reset it — no OTP or email required.",
