    "showcaseExampleLabel": "A sample from inside the app",
    "showcaseLifeSkillsExampleTitle": "Module 1, Chapter 1 — \"Your Marks Are Not Your Worth\" (Student track)",
    "showcaseLifeSkillsExampleBody": "A test tells you what you know about one topic, on one day — not whether you're a good or bad person. When you get something wrong, say to yourself: \"this tells me what to look at next,\" not \"this tells me I'm bad at this.\"",
    "showcaseLifeSkillsRest": "The rest of this chapter — plus 11 more modules — unlocks week by week inside the app.",
    "showcaseScreenlessExampleTitle": "Sample question — Class 8 Mock Test Booklet",
    "showcaseScreenlessExampleBody": "Using Nikhilam: What is 96 × 97?\nBoth numbers are close to the base 100. Deficits: 96→4, 97→3. Cross-subtract: 96−3=93. Multiply deficits: 4×3=12. Answer: 9312.",
    "showcaseScreenlessRest": "34 more questions like this in every monthly booklet — pen, paper, and full explanations.",
